---
// The facts of the case: year counter, progress bar and timeline.
// data-nosnippet (Google allows it on span, div and section): Google quoted this line as the search result's
// description instead of the one in site.ts.

---
<section class="slide bg-orange s-facts" id="the-facts" data-ink="#000" data-label="The facts" data-fx="wipe" data-fxc="#E5481E">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="f-left">
      <span class="who a" style="--d:.1s">The facts of the case</span>
      <h2 class="big f-year a" style="--d:.25s;--an:popin"><span data-yr="label">Year 2 of 4</span></h2>
      <p class="f-sub a" style="--d:.55s"><span data-nosnippet>Information Systems at King Abdulaziz University. <b>He is a <span data-yr="ordinal">second</span>-year student. Most of this evidence comes from his first year, and it all started with a server he built in high school.</b></span></p>
      <div class="f-bar a" style="--d:.8s" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="f-seg"><i></i><span>Year 1</span></div>
        <div class="f-seg"><i></i><span>Year 2</span></div>
        <div class="f-seg"><i></i><span>Year 3</span></div>
        <div class="f-seg"><i></i><span>Year 4</span></div>
        <b class="f-now"><span>Now</span></b>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="f-right">
      <div class="f-group a" style="--d:1s">
        <h3>In his first year</h3>
        <ol class="f-list">
          <li><time>Feb 2026</time><span>Led the AI team for KAU’s largest event</span></li>
          <li><time>Mar 2026</time><span>Hired by Tabby as a DevOps engineering intern</span></li>
          <li><time>Mar 2026</time><span>Selected as a BCG Jeel Tamooh Fellow</span></li>
          <li><time>Apr 2026</time><span>Won TechHub after 48 hours of building</span></li>
          <li><time>May 2026</time><span>Taught 55+ students to deploy to the cloud</span></li>
          <li><time>Jul 2026</time><span>Shipped his first live service</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="f-group a" style="--d:1.25s">
        <h3><span data-yr="y2title">Year two, so far</span></h3>
        <ol class="f-list">
          <li><time>Sep 2026</time><span>Won TCS Sustainathon Saudi Arabia 2026</span></li>
          <li><time>Oct 2026</time><span>Tabby’s CIO extended his internship</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
